{{also|BrE|BRE}}
==Albanian==

===Etymology===
Probably a short form of {{etyl|ine-pro|sq}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*bhrā́ter-||brother}}. Compare Illyrian {{l|sq|bra||brother}}, {{etyl|cu|-}} {{term|bratъ|lang=cu}}, Old Prussian {{term|brāti|lang=prg}}, Old Norse {{term|broðir|lang=non||brother}}.

===Interjection===
{{head|sq|interjection}}

# A friendly [[exclamation]] to a [[person]].
#: Folni '''''bre''', burra!
#:: Speak, '''''therefore''', men!
# An [[exclamation]] of [[surprise]].
#: '''''Bre'''! Po ç'është kjo?
#:: '''''Man'''! What is this?

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|sq|brez}}

