==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|tr|sh}} {{term|bre|lang=tr}}.

===Interjection===
{{sh-interjection|r|бре}}

(Bre is not used in Croatian language.)

# {{context|intensifier|lang=sh}} used to express passion about the point of a sentence, at any part of a sentence
# {{context|intensifier|lang=sh}} similar to English [[fuck]] or [[hell]], but not vulgar, e.g.:
#: ''Šta si '''bre''' to uradio!?'' (What the '''[[fuck#Intensifier|fuck]]''' did you do!?)
# [[hey]]
# {{context|slang|lang=sh}} [[yo]]

